    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KNOCKOFF</strong> is a first of its kind Iso-fighter RPG that takes heavy influence from traditional 2D &amp; 3D Fighting Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/ad94e5290d0e0d4737c57f9d46b9c867.poster.avif?t=1755586204\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/ad94e5290d0e0d4737c57f9d46b9c867.webm?t=1755586204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/ad94e5290d0e0d4737c57f9d46b9c867.mp4?t=1755586204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the PVP demo is out now, and the full game is in development, which will feature ~15 hours of gameplay in <i><u>THE WORLD Shopping Center</u></i>, a endless, dead mall filled with ghosts,\u00a0 skeletons, and sprites. The world around you which once glittered with polish now glows only from ghost light. You play as the wanderer Amy, searching for an Exit. Make friends and unlock more characters along your journey: a lightning quick skateboarder, a lonely genius operating a monstrous machine, a possessed mannequin aching to feel alive... Try not to die, and never let the suffocating darkness wipe that smile off your face :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-PLUSHCATBOY</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KNOCKOFF</strong> is a first of its kind Iso-fighter RPG that takes heavy influence from traditional 2D &amp; 3D Fighting Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/ad94e5290d0e0d4737c57f9d46b9c867.poster.avif?t=1755586204\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/ad94e5290d0e0d4737c57f9d46b9c867.webm?t=1755586204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/ad94e5290d0e0d4737c57f9d46b9c867.mp4?t=1755586204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the PVP demo is out now, and the full game is in development, which will feature ~15 hours of gameplay in <i><u>THE WORLD Shopping Center</u></i>, a endless, dead mall filled with ghosts,\u00a0 skeletons, and sprites. The world around you which once glittered with polish now glows only from ghost light. You play as the wanderer Amy, searching for an Exit. Make friends and unlock more characters along your journey: a lightning quick skateboarder, a lonely genius operating a monstrous machine, a possessed mannequin aching to feel alive... Try not to die, and never let the suffocating darkness wipe that smile off your face :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-PLUSHCATBOY</p>",
    "short_description": "KNOCKOFF is an upcoming Iso-fighter RPG, set in a dead and haunted mall taken over by various gangs. Featuring a blend of RPG decision making and fighting game inspired combat, KNOCKOFF is like nothing you've ever seen.",
